WEBVTT

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:30.226
so I'm not sure why they let me in.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.476
(Laughter)

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.976
But if we're talking
about colliding with a power

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.601
that's bigger than us,

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:38.226
then I'm in the right place,

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.643
because this last year,

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.476
I had an interesting year with a movie
called "Crazy Rich Asians" that I did --

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.518
(Applause and cheers)

00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:46.518
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:46.542 --> 00:00:49.434
And if we're talking about
connection specifically today,

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:52.059
then I know my story is only possible

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:56.018
because of a collection of connections
that happened throughout my life,

00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:58.726
and so hopefully by telling
a little bit of my story,

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:02.476
it will help someone else find their path
a little sooner than I did.